---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="ShotMark Roadmap" description="The priorities shaping ShotMark: quick capture, clearer browsing, and useful context without clutter." canonicalPath="/roadmap/">
  <main id="main-content" class="document-page wrap">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Roadmap</p>
      <h1>Thoughtfully small.<br />Always getting better.</h1>
      <p class="lede">ShotMark’s direction is simple: make it easier to save the reason, then find it when you need it.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="capture-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Capture</p>
        <h2 id="capture-title">Keep the moment moving.</h2>
        <p>Keep saving from the Share Sheet fast and clear. Make adding a short note feel natural, and keep the path from screenshot to saved card reassuringly simple.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="recall-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Recall</p>
        <h2 id="recall-title">Less searching for the search.</h2>
        <p>Continue refining readable cards, useful search and filters, and responsive library browsing. The right screenshot should be easy to recognize and quick to reopen.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="context-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Context</p>
        <h2 id="context-title">Organization that stays light.</h2>
        <p>Improve the everyday flow of notes, Collections, and Projects while protecting ShotMark’s calm, focused feel. Organization should help you return to an idea without becoming another job.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="polish-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Polish</p>
        <h2 id="polish-title">A good fit on every screen.</h2>
        <p>Keep improving clarity, accessibility, and the small interactions that make ShotMark comfortable on iPhone, iPad, and Mac.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="feedback-title">
        <h2 id="feedback-title">What would make your day easier?</h2>
        <p>These are product priorities, not promised features or release dates. Plans may change as we learn what helps most. Visit <a href="/updates/">Updates</a> for features that have already shipped.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@zhenchyi.com?subject=ShotMark%20Feedback">Share an idea <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
